#! ia 1.0

@schema check
  lowers to check
  sections
    must have meaning
    must have check
    may have relationships
    may have governance
    closed
  fields
    must have meaning.says as text
    must have meaning.answers as text
    may have check.implementation as text "The evaluator that runs the check: a built-in or catalog evaluator id, the same value check.runs takes, and equal to it when both are stated. The <id>@<version> form of evidence.implementation is not accepted here."
    may have check.runs as id
    must have check.scope as text "What the check selects: the whole-workspace token *, a scope its evaluator reports, or prose. It is text and claims no path; check.covers does."
    may have check.covers as list of text "Path selections the check claims, matched by the location resolver. Claiming a path does not change which verdicts the check selects; check.scope does that."
